.TH PHYLLO-DOCTOR 1 "Phyllotaxis" "phyllo" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
phyllo-doctor \- diagnose project integration without mutation
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B phyllo doctor
.RB [ --format
.BR text | json ]
.RB [ --quiet ]
.br
.B phyllo doctor --help
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B phyllo doctor
composes canonical status resolution and contract validation.
It may include resolved status context in the versioned JSON result.
Doctor does not modify project files, execute project-provided scripts,
or apply automatic remediation.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --format text|json
Select human-readable text or the versioned JSON result. Text is the default.
.TP
.B --quiet
Suppress non-error human success and informational output. It does not suppress
errors, alter machine output, or change the exit status.
.TP
.B --help
Display command help without discovering a project.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Inspection and canonical validation succeeded.
.TP
.B 1
Contract validation found violations.
.TP
.B 2
Usage, configuration, or required package resolution error.
.TP
.B 3
Operational error prevented diagnosis.
.TP
.B 4
Unexpected internal CLI failure.
.TP
.B 130
Interrupted by SIGINT where the platform/runtime uses conventional signal propagation.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phyllo (1),
.BR phyllo-status (1),
.BR phyllo-check (1)
